        "original_id": "86270876-2460-5488-b4fe-32dc3933ca46",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Philip Hill-Pearson, David Tennant, James Strong, Chris Chibnall, Jimmy Murphy, Bobby Charlton, Jack O'Connell, Steven Spielberg, Michael Morpurgo\n- Works: Good Cop, Doctors, United, War Horse\n- Topics: British television film, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Philip Hill-Pearson later worked on the television programs Good Cop and Doctors.\n- Philip Hill-Pearson also appeared in the film United with David Tennant.\n- United is a 2011 British television film directed by James Strong and written by Chris Chibnall.\n- United focuses in particular on the experiences of assistant manager Jimmy Murphy, who is played by David Tennant, and Bobby Charlton, who is played by Jack O'Connell.\n- Philip Hill-Pearson also appeared in Steven Spielberg's adaptation of Michael Morpurgo's War Horse.",
